@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1

@bookingTag = 9001
@bookingUserId = 1
@bookingEmployeeDbId = 1
@bookingVehicleId = 1
@bookingHappyId = 1
@bookingRejectId = 2
@bookingCancelId = 1

### 19. (ELOFELTETEL) USER LETREHOZAS A BOOKING EMPLOYEE-HEZ
### FONTOS: allitsd a felso @bookingUserId-t a valaszban kapott id-ra.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "booking.user.{{bookingTag}}@fleetfalcon.local",
  "passwordHash": "BookingPass123!",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}


### 20. (ELOFELTETEL) EMPLOYEE LETREHOZAS
### FONTOS: allitsd a felso @bookingEmployeeDbId-t a valaszban kapott id-ra.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Booking",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "employeeId": "EMP-BOOK-{{bookingTag}}",
  "user": {
    "id": {{bookingUserId}}
  },
  "phoneNumber": "+3630222{{bookingTag}}",
  "drivingLicenseNumber": "DL-BOOK-{{bookingTag}}",
  "department": "QA"
}


### 21. (ELOFELTETEL) VEHICLE LETREHOZAS
### FONTOS: allitsd a felso @bookingVehicleId-t a valaszban kapott id-ra.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Skoda",
  "model": "Octavia",
  "licensePlate": "BOOK-{{bookingTag}}",
  "vehicleType": "CAR",
  "fuelType": "PETROL",
  "releaseYear": 2022,
  "dailyPrice": 15000,
  "seatingCapacity": 5,
  "description": "Booking lifecycle test vehicle",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "currentMileage": 50000,
  "inspectionValidUntil": "2027-12-31",
  "nextServiceMileage": 60000,
  "nextServiceDate": "2026-10-01"
}


### 22. HAPPY PATH - BOOKING LETREHOZAS (PENDING)
### FONTOS: allitsd a felso @bookingHappyId-t a valaszban kapott id-ra.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{bookingVehicleId}},
  "employeeId": {{bookingEmployeeDbId}},
  "startDate": "2026-08-01T08:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-03T18:00:00"
}


### 23. HAPPY PATH - JOvAHAGYAS (APPROVED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingHappyId}}/approve


### 24. HAPPY PATH - START (ACTIVE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingHappyId}}/start?mileage=50000


### 25. HAPPY PATH - END (COMPLETED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingHappyId}}/end?mileage=50220


### 26. ELLENORZES - STATUS SZURES (COMPLETED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings?status=COMPLETED


### 27. ELLENORZES - EMPLOYEE NAME SZURES
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings?employeeName=booking


### 28. ELLENORZES - EMPLOYEE ID SZURES
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings?employeeId=EMP-BOOK-{{bookingTag}}


### 29. REJECT AG - UJ BOOKING LETREHOZAS
### FONTOS: allitsd a felso @bookingRejectId-t a valaszban kapott id-ra.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{bookingVehicleId}},
  "employeeId": {{bookingEmployeeDbId}},
  "startDate": "2026-08-10T08:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-12T18:00:00"
}


### 30. REJECT AG - ELUTASITAS (REJECTED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingRejectId}}/reject


### 31. CANCEL AG - UJ BOOKING LETREHOZAS
### FONTOS: allitsd a felso @bookingCancelId-t a valaszban kapott id-ra.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{bookingVehicleId}},
  "employeeId": {{bookingEmployeeDbId}},
  "startDate": "2026-08-20T08:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-22T18:00:00"
}


### 32. CANCEL AG - JOvAHAGYAS (APPROVED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingCancelId}}/approve


### 33. CANCEL AG - LEMONDAS (CANCELLED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingCancelId}}/cancel


### 34. STATUS FRISSITES ENDPOINT TESZT (PUT /status)
### FIGYELEM: Ez kozvetlen status allitas, uzleti validacio nelkul.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingRejectId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}


### 35. VEGSO LISTA
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings

### 1. FELHASZNALO LETREHOZAS
### Elvart: 200 OK + JSON benne id/email/role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user.test@fleetfalcon.local",
  "passwordHash": "InitPass123!",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}


### 2. FELHASZNALO LEKERESE ID ALAPJAN
### FONTOS: allitsd az @userId valtozot felul a letrehozott id-re.
### Elvart: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}


### 3. JELSZO FRISSITES (HELYES AKTUALIS JELSZO)
### Elvart: 204 No Content
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "InitPass123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPass456!"
}


### 4. NEGATIV TESZT - HIBAS AKTUALIS JELSZO
### Elvart: hiba (jelenlegi implementacioban valoszinuleg 500 RuntimeException)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "WrongPass999!",
  "newPassword": "AnotherPass789!"
}


### 5. FELHASZNALO TORLESE
### Elvart: 200 OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}


### 6. TOROLT FELHASZNALO LEKERESE
### Elvart: hiba (jelenlegi implementacioban valoszinuleg 500 RuntimeException)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}


### 7. VEGSO LISTA
### Elvart: 200 OK es a torolt user mar ne legyen benne.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

